A braced opener forms before an enclosing closer takes its block

```
={_a={c_}
.
<p>=<u>a={c</u></p>
```

```
_{*_{t=a*}
.
<p>_<strong>_{t=a</strong></p>
```

```
/{^a/{k=b^}
.
<p>/<sup>a/{k=b</sup></p>
```

```
~{,a~{k=b,}
.
<p>~<sub>a~{k=b</sub></p>
```

```
*{=a*{k=b=}
.
<p>*<mark>a*{k=b</mark></p>
```

```
={/a={k=b/}
.
<p>=<em>a={k=b</em></p>
```

```
_{~a_{k=b~}
.
<p>_<s>a_{k=b</s></p>
```

```
/{+a/{k=b+}
.
<p>/<ins>a/{k=b</ins></p>
```

```
~{-a~{k=b-}
.
<p>~<del>a~{k=b</del></p>
```

```
*{#a*{k=b#}
.
<p>*<span class="critic-comment">a*{k=b</span></p>
```

```
={_a={c} b_}
.
<p>=<u>a={c} b</u></p>
```

```
={_a=b_}
.
<p>=<u>a=b</u></p>
```

```
a*{_k=b_}
.
<p>a*<u>k=b</u></p>
```

```
*a*{_k=b_}
.
<p><strong _k="b_">a</strong></p>
```
